    "text": "<p>Given that,</p><p>For a reaction,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2955</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Using Nernst equation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi>nF</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0591</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>logk</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>at</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2955</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0591</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p>Therefore, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></math>.</p>",
